WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,720
distinguished guest

2
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,280
any need

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,950
You can come to me, the train conductor

4
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,740
I want you to give me an explanation

5
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:18,770
distinguished guest

6
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,690
Why is everything weird on the train?

7
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:21,810
They all want to be rough with me

8
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:25,640
What is the power of my Black Diamond membership?

9
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:29,610
If you want to disobey the rules, it's okay.

10
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,970
There must be some misunderstanding. I'll come over right now.

11
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:46,010
Dear guest, are you okay?

12
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:47,610
I didn't say anything in advance

13
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,010
I disturbed you

14
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:52,310
Still not apologizing to our distinguished black diamond customers
